  "job_B17.1_20251003_114356": {
    "chunk_text": "& Her Cu\u00fered cyning gefeaht uui\u00fe \u00e6\u00feelhun \u00feone ofermedan aldormonn. Her cu\u00fered gefeaht \u00fey xii geare his rices \u00e6t Beorgfeorda wi\u00fe \u00e6\u00feelbald. Her Cu\u00fered feaht wi\u00fe Walas. Her cu\u00fered for\u00feferde, & Cyneheard onfeng biscepdome \u00e6fter Hunfer\u00fee on Wintanceastre; & Her Cynewulf benam Sigebryht his rices & West Seaxna wiotan for unryhtum d\u00e6dum, buton & he wr\u00e6c \u00feone aldor mon Cumbran; & se Cynewulf oft miclum gefeohtum feaht uui\u00fe Bretwalum; & \u00fea geascode he \u00feone cyning lytle werode on wifcy\u00fe\u00fee on Merantune, & hine \u00fe\u00e6r berad, & \u00feone & \u00fea ongeat se cyning \u00fe\u00e6t, & he on \u00fea duru eode, & \u00fea unheanlice hine werede, o\u00fe he on \u00feone & hie alle on \u00feone Cyning w\u00e6run feohtende o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hie hine ofsl\u00e6genne h\u00e6fdon; & \u00fea on \u00fe\u00e6s Ac hie simle feohtende w\u00e6ran o\u00fe hie alle l\u00e6gon butan anum Bryttiscum gisle, & se swi\u00fee \u00d0a on morgenne gehierdun \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges \u00feegnas \u00fee him be\u00e6ftan w\u00e6run \u00fe\u00e6t se cyning & \u00fea gebead he him hiera agenne dom feos & londes gif hie him \u00fe\u00e6s rices u\u00feon, & him cy\u00fedon & \u00fea cu\u00e6don hie \u00fe\u00e6t him n\u00e6nig m\u00e6g leofra n\u00e6re \u00feonne hiera hlaford, & hie n\u00e6fre his banan & hie cu\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t t\u00e6t ilce hiera geferum geboden w\u00e6re,",
